outil qui diagnostique et résout les problèmes d''équipe et de roster","de":"Der Team-Reconcile-Agent ist ein Tool, das Team- und Rosterprobleme diagnostiziert und behebt","pt":"O Team-Reconcile é uma ferramenta de diagnóstico e correção de problemas de equipe","ru":"ИИ Агент Team-Reconcile - это инструмент диагностики и исправления проблем с командой","ar":"أداة الفريق-المصالح هي أداة تشخيص وعلاج مشاكل الفريق"},"features":{"en":["Diagnoses team vs recruits index discrepancies via dry-run","Applies fixes when `canFix: true`","Verifies user appearance in the roster after fix","Investigates user/team specified in invocation","Executes tasks based on $ARGUMENTS user input","Performs critical input handling for accurate results"],"zh":["支持团队索引修复","诊断和修复团队和招募索引不一致问题","确保用户出现在名单中","支持命令行界面（CLI）","提供详细的错误信息和调试日志"],"ja":["チームインデックスの修復をサポート","チームとリクルートのインデックスの不一致を診断と修復","ユーザーがリストに表示されることを保証","コマンドラインインターフェース（CLI）をサポート","詳細なエラーメッセージとデバッグログを提供"],"ko":["팀 인덱스 재설정을 지원","팀과 모집 인덱스의 불일치를 진단하고 수정","사용자가 명단에 표시되도록 함","명령줄 인터페이스（CLI）를 지원","詳細한 오류 메시지와 디버깅 로그를 제공"],"es":["Diagnóstico de discrepancias de índice de equipo y roster","Reparación automática de problemas de equipo y roster","Verificación de la presencia del usuario en el roster","Soporte para la plataforma de Reset Metabólico de 28 días","Manejo de entrada de usuario para diagnosticar y solucionar problemas","Funcionalidad de ejecución en seco para pruebas"],"fr":["Diagnostic des disparités d''index d''équipe et de roster","Réparation automatique des problèmes d''équipe et de roster","Vérification de la présence de l''utilisateur dans le roster","Support pour la plateforme de Reset Métabolique de 28 jours","Gestion de l''entrée de l''utilisateur pour diagnostiquer et résoudre les problèmes","Fonctionnalité d''exécution en sec pour les tests"],"de":["Diagnose von Index-Discrepanzen von Team und Roster","Automatische Behebung von Team- und Rosterproblemen","Überprüfung der Anwesenheit des Benutzers im Roster","Unterstützung für die Plattform für metabolischen Reset von 28 Tagen","Benutzereingabe-Verwaltung zur Diagnose und Behebung von Problemen","Funktion für Trockenlauf-Tests"],"pt":["Diagnóstico de problemas de equipe","Correção de discrepâncias de índice de equipe","Processamento de entrada de usuário via CLI","Verificação de presença do usuário na lista de equipe","Suporte à plataforma de Metabolic Reset"],"ru":["Диагностика проблем с командой","Исправление несоответствий индекса команды","Обработка входных данных пользователя через CLI","Проверка присутствия пользователя в списке команды","Поддержка платформы 28-Дневного Метаболического Перезапуска"],"ar":["تشخيص مشاكل الفريق","تصحيح اختلافات في فهرس الفريق","معالجة إدخال المستخدم عبر CLI","التحقق من وجود المستخدم في قائمة الفريق","دعم منصة استعادة الأيض"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use team-reconcile","team-reconcile setup guide","28-Day Metabolic Reset troubleshooting","team-reconcile alternative","team-reconcile vs roster repair tools","what is team-reconcile","team-reconcile install","diagnosing team index discrepancies","resolving roster issues in 28-Day Metabolic Reset"],"zh":["团队重置工具","团队索引修复","AI工具","命令行界面","错误信息","调试日志","团队管理","索引不一致"],"ja":["チームリコンシールツール","チームインデックスの修復","AIエージェント","コマンドラインインターフェース","エラーメッセージ","デバッグログ","チーム管理","インデックスの不一致"],"ko":["팀 리콘실 툴","팀 인덱스 재설정","AI 툴","명령줄 인터페이스","오류 메시지","디버깅 로그","팀 관리","인덱스의 불일치"],"es":["agente de reconciliación de equipos","reset metabólico","diagnóstico de problemas de equipo","reparación de roster","herramientas de AI para equipos","solución de problemas de equipo y roster","configuración de agente de equipo","integración de equipo y roster","automatización de procesos de equipo"],"fr":["agent de réconciliation d''équipe","reset métabolique","diagnostic des problèmes d''équipe","réparation de roster","outils d''IA pour équipes","résolution de problèmes d''équipe et de roster","configuration de l''agent d''équipe","intégration d''équipe et de roster","automatisation des processus d''équipe"],"de":["Team-Reconcile-Agent","metabolischer Reset","Diagnose von Teamproblemen","Behebung von Rosterproblemen","AI-Tools für Teams","Lösung von Team- und Rosterproblemen","Einrichtung des Team-Agents","Integration von Team und Roster","Automatisierung von Teamprozessen"],"pt":["Team-Reconcile","Metabolic Reset","diagnóstico de problemas de equipe","correção de discrepâncias de índice de equipe","CLI","processamento de entrada de usuário","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Team-Reconcile","28-Дневный Метаболический Перезапуск","диагностика проблем с командой","исправление несоответствий индекса команды","CLI","обработка входных данных пользователя","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أداة الفريق-المصالح","استعادة الأيض","تشخيص مشاكل الفريق","تصحيح اختلافات في فهرس الفريق","CLI","معالجة إدخال المستخدم","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"QuicksilverSlick","repo":"Metabolic-reset","repoPath":"QuicksilverSlick/Metabolic-reset","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T22:59:27Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"team-reconcile","description":"Team Index Reconciliation for 28-Day Metabolic Reset. Diagnoses and fixes users missing from facilitator group rosters due to team/recruits index desync. Resolves genealogy vs roster mismatches, captainId null issues, and partial enrollment index writes. Handles missing team member, roster discrepancy, group member not showing, genealogy vs roster mismatch, team index repair, user not in roster, facilitator cant see member, recruits index orphan, team assignment broken, or cohort roster missing user.","bodyPreview":"# Team Index Reconciliation\n\nDiagnose and fix team/roster issues for the 28-Day Metabolic Reset platform:\n\n**User Input:** $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Task\n\n1. Find the affected user or facilitator specified above\n2. Diagnose team vs recruits index discrepancies (dry-run first)\n3. Apply fix if `canFix: true`\n4. Verify the user now appears in the roster\n\n## CRITICAL: Input Handling\n\n**You MUST investigate the user/team specified in the invocation above — NOT any example names in this documentation.**\n\n---\n\n##","body":"# Team Index Reconciliation\n\nDiagnose and fix team/roster issues for the 28-Day Metabolic Reset platform:\n\n**User Input:** $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Task\n\n1. Find the affected user or facilitator specified above\n2. Diagnose team vs recruits index discrepancies (dry-run first)\n3. Apply fix if `canFix: true`\n4. Verify the user now appears in the roster\n\n## CRITICAL: Input Handling\n\n**You MUST investigate the user/team specified in the invocation above — NOT any example names in this documentation.**\n\n---\n\n## ⛔ MANDATORY GUARDRAILS — STOP-GATES THAT CANNOT BE SKIPPED\n\n### GATE 1: Ghost User Detection\n**ALWAYS search BOTH DO and D1** before any team fix:\n```\n1. GET /api/debug/find-user?name={query}           → DO index\n2. GET /api/admin/user-directory/search?q={query}   → D1 (catches ghosts)\n3. If IDs differ → D1 ID IS CORRECT. Do NOT reconcile with ghost ID.\n```\n\n### GATE 2: Context Recovery\nBefore starting, check for prior triage: `SELECT id, status, admin_notes FROM bug_reports WHERE user_id = ''{userId}''`\n\n### GATE 3: API Retry\nIf any API returns 500: wait 5s → retry → wait 15s → retry. Never conclude from 1 failure.\n\n### GATE 4: SMS After Fix (MANDATORY)\nAfter EVERY team reconciliation fix, SMS the user AND optionally the facilitator via Google Voice. CANNOT mark bug resolved until SMS is sent.\n\n### GATE 5: Blast Radius\nAfter fixing one user''s team, check: does the same facilitator have more missing members? Run `POST /api/admin/reconcile-team-indexes {\"groupLeaderId\":\"...\", \"fix\": false}` on the facilitator to find ALL discrepancies, not just the reported one.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices & Current Knowledge\n\n**MANDATORY**: Always research and apply current best practices for the current month and year. Check the current date from your context (CLAUDE.md, MEMORY.md, or system prompts).\n\n1. **Check bug triage first**: Before starting, read `.claude/bug-triage/known-bugs.md` to check if this team/roster issue has been previously reported (see BUG-001 and related entries).\n2. **Pattern matching**: Check `.claude/bug-triage/patterns.md` — Pattern 2 (Index Desync) is the most common root cause for team/roster issues.\n3. **Use WebSearch**: For unfamiliar error patterns not covered in this skill, search for current Cloudflare Workers / Durable Objects solutions (include the current month and year in your search).\n4. **After resolution**: Update `.claude/bug-triage/known-bugs.md` if you discover a novel bug or new variant of the index desync pattern.\n\n---\n\n## The Problem You Solve\n\nThe system maintains two separate indexes for group/team relationships:\n\n```\nteam:{captainId}     → Users shown in GROUP ROSTER (what facilitators see)\nrecruits:{captainId} → Users shown in GENEALOGY (referral tree)\n```\n\n**When these indexes get out of sync**, users may:\n- Appear in genealogy but NOT in the group members roster\n- Have a `captainId` pointing to a facilitator but not appear on their team\n- Be \"invisible\" to their group leader\n\n## Root Causes\n\n1. **Registration without referral**: User joined via coupon/direct link, got `captainId` assigned but no `recruiterId`\n2. **Admin reassignment bug**: Older admin endpoints updated `recruits:` but not `team:`\n3. **Data migration**: Historical users moved between teams without full index updates\n4. **Partial writes**: System interruption during enrollment left indexes inconsistent\n\n---\n\n## Authentication\n\n**CRITICAL**: All API calls require the admin user ID for authentication.\n\n```\nADMIN_USER_ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\nBASE_URL: https://28dayreset.com\n```\n\nEvery curl command MUST include: `-H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"`\n\n---\n\n## Available Tools\n\n### Discovery\n\n```bash\n# Find user by name\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/debug/find-user?name={query}\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"\n\n# Find user by phone (last 4-10 digits)\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/debug/find-user?phone={digits}\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"\n\n# Get full user details (includes captainId, recruitedById, role)\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/admin/users/{userId}\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"\n\n# List all facilitators/coaches\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/admin/facilitators\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"\n```\n\n### Diagnosis\n\n```bash\n# Diagnose team vs recruits index discrepancies for a group leader\n# Shows who''s in recruits but not team, and vice versa\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://28dayreset.com/api/admin/reconcile-team-indexes\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"groupLeaderId\": \"{facilitatorUserId}\", \"fix\": false}''\n```\n\n**Response includes:**\n```json\n{\n  \"groupLeader\": { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"Ginny Howery\" },\n  \"teamIndexCount\": 11,\n  \"recruitsIndexCount\": 13,\n  \"inTeamNotRecruits\": 0,\n  \"inRecruitsNotTeam\": 2,\n  \"discrepancies\": [\n    {\n      \"userId\": \"...\",\n      \"userName\": \"Diana Decker\",\n      \"issue\": \"In recruits index but NOT in team index\",\n      \"captainId\": \"...\",\n      \"canFix\": true,\n      \"fixed\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"fixApplied\": false\n}\n```\n\n```bash\n# Get group leader''s current roster (what they see in UI)\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/roster\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: {facilitatorUserId}\"\n\n# Verify referral relationships for a facilitator\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/debug/verify-referrals/{facilitatorUserId}\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"\n```\n\n### Remediation\n\n```bash\n# Fix team index discrepancies (add missing users to team index)\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://28dayreset.com/api/admin/reconcile-team-indexes\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"groupLeaderId\": \"{facilitatorUserId}\", \"fix\": true}''\n\n# Manually reassign a user to a different team (updates both indexes)\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://28dayreset.com/api/orphan/assign\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: {userBeingReassigned}\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"captainId\": \"{newFacilitatorUserId}\"}''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Framework\n\n### `canFix: true` Cases\n\nThe reconcile endpoint reports `canFix: true` when:\n- User''s `captainId` matches the group leader\n- User is NOT a facilitator themselves (facilitators have their own teams)\n- User is NOT the group leader (can''t be on your own team)\n\n**Action**: Apply fix with `\"fix\": true`\n\n### `canFix: false` Cases\n\n| Scenario | Reason | Action |\n|----------|--------|--------|\n| User is group leader | Can''t be in own team | No action needed |\n| User is a facilitator | Has own team | Verify correct team assignment |\n| `captainId` doesn''t match | Belongs to different team | Investigate - may need admin reassignment |\n\n---\n\n## Standard Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Find the affected user and their facilitator\n\n```bash\n# Find the user who is \"missing\" from roster\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/debug/find-user?name={userName}\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"\n\n# Get their details to see captainId\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/admin/users/{userId}\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"\n```\n\n**Key fields to extract:**\n- `captainId` - Who is their assigned group leader?\n- `recruitedById` - Who referred them? (may be null)\n- `role` - Should be \"challenger\" for regular participants\n\n### Step 2: Find the facilitator\n\n```bash\n# Find facilitator by name\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/debug/find-user?name={facilitatorName}\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\"\n```\n\n**Verify:**\n- `role` should be \"coach\" or \"facilitator\"\n- User''s `captainId` should match facilitator''s ID\n\n### Step 3: Diagnose the discrepancy\n\n```bash\n# Run diagnosis (dry run)\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://28dayreset.com/api/admin/reconcile-team-indexes\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"groupLeaderId\": \"{facilitatorUserId}\", \"fix\": false}''\n```\n\n**Review output:**\n- Check `inRecruitsNotTeam` count\n- Find the user in `discrepancies` array\n- Confirm `canFix: true`\n\n### Step 4: Apply the fix\n\n```bash\n# Apply fix\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://28dayreset.com/api/admin/reconcile-team-indexes\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: 0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"groupLeaderId\": \"{facilitatorUserId}\", \"fix\": true}''\n```\n\n**Verify `\"fixed\": true`** in the response for the affected user.\n\n### Step 5: Verify the fix\n\n```bash\n# Check facilitator''s roster now includes the user\ncurl -s \"https://28dayreset.com/api/roster\" \\\n  -H \"X-User-ID: {facilitatorUserId}\"\n```\n\n**Confirm** the previously missing user now appears in the roster.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Team Reconciliation: {User Name}\n\n**User ID**: {userId}\n**Facilitator**: {facilitatorName} ({facilitatorId})\n**Verdict**: FIXED | NO_ACTION_NEEDED | NEEDS_MANUAL_REVIEW\n\n### Problem Summary\n{One sentence describing what was wrong}\n\n### Diagnosis\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| User''s `captainId` | {captainId} |\n| User''s `recruitedById` | {recruitedById or NULL} |\n| User''s Role | {role} |\n| In team index? | {Yes/No} |\n| In recruits index? | {Yes/No} |\n\n### Index State Before Fix\n\n| Index | Count | User Present? |\n|-------|-------|---------------|\n| `team:{facilitatorId}` | {N} | {Yes/No} |\n| `recruits:{facilitatorId}` | {N} | {Yes/No} |\n\n### Root Cause\n{Explanation of why this happened}\n\n### Actions Taken\n{What was done to fix it}\n\n### Verification\n- Roster now shows {N} members (was {N-1})\n- {userName} confirmed present in roster\n\n### Notes\n{Any additional context or recommendations}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: User in genealogy but not roster\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Facilitator sees user in \"My Genealogy\" or referral tree\n- User does NOT appear in \"Group Members\" roster\n- User''s `captainId` is correctly set\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\nPOST /api/admin/reconcile-team-indexes\n{\"groupLeaderId\": \"...\", \"fix\": false}\n# Shows: inRecruitsNotTeam > 0\n```\n\n**Fix:**\n```bash\nPOST /api/admin/reconcile-team-indexes\n{\"groupLeaderId\": \"...\", \"fix\": true}\n```\n\n### Scenario 2: User joined via coupon without referral\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- User has `captainId` set\n- User has `recruitedById: null`\n- User not in facilitator''s roster\n\n**Root Cause:** Registration flow pre-fix didn''t add to team index when no referrer\n\n**Fix:** Same as Scenario 1 - reconcile endpoint handles this\n\n### Scenario 3: User shows in wrong team''s genealogy\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- User appears in Facilitator A''s genealogy\n- User should be on Facilitator B''s team\n- User''s `captainId` points to Facilitator B\n\n**Diagnosis:** Check `captainId` vs which genealogy they appear in\n\n**Fix:** May need admin reassignment if data is corrupted\n\n---\n\n## Post-Fix: SMS Notification & Bug Report (MANDATORY)\n\nAfter EVERY team reconciliation fix:\n\n1. **SMS the user via Google Voice** — Navigate to `https://voice.google.com/u/0/messages`, send SMS to the affected user''s phone confirming they now appear in their team''s roster. This is MANDATORY for user-facing issues.\n2. **SMS the facilitator** (optional) — Let the group leader know their team member has been added.\n3. **Update bug report** — If a bug report exists:\n   - Post admin message: `POST /api/bugs/{bugId}/messages` with explanation\n   - Mark resolved: `PATCH /api/admin/bugs/{bugId}` with `{\"status\": \"resolved\"}`\n\n### SMS Templates\n\n**For user (roster fix):**\n```\nHi {firstName}, this is the 28-Day Reset support team. We''ve fixed an issue with your team assignment - you should now appear correctly in your group leader''s roster. Let us know if you need anything.\n```\n\n**For facilitator (team member added):**\n```\nHi {facilitatorName}, this is 28-Day Reset support. We''ve resolved an issue for {userName} on your team. They should now appear correctly in your roster.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Safety Rules\n\n1. **Always diagnose first** - Run with `\"fix\": false` before applying\n2. **Verify facilitator identity** - Confirm the group leader exists and has correct role\n3. **Check `canFix`** - Only apply fixes where the endpoint says it''s safe\n4. **Verify after fix** - Always confirm the user now appears in roster\n5. **Document changes** - Report what was fixed and why\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Admin User ID**: `0f950f68-885c-47f9-9cb4-aabbb8bea55f`\n**Base URL**: `https://28dayreset.com`\n\n**Key Endpoints:**\n| Purpose | Endpoint |\n|---------|----------|\n| Find user | `GET /api/debug/find-user?name={query}` |\n| User details | `GET /api/admin/users/{userId}` |\n| List facilitators | `GET /api/admin/facilitators` |\n| Diagnose/Fix | `POST /api/admin/reconcile-team-indexes` |\n| View roster | `GET /api/roster` (as facilitator) |\n| Reassign user | `POST /api/orphan/assign` |\n\n**Index Names:**\n- `team:{captainId}` - Roster membership\n- `recruits:{captainId}` - Genealogy/referral tree\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:11:42.242Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Administrative Agents needing advanced team and roster management capabilities for the 28-Day Metabolic Reset platform.","zh":"非常适合需要高级团队和名单管理功能的行政代理，尤其适用于28-Day Metabolic Reset平台。","ja":"行政エージェントがチームおよびロースター管理の高度な機能を必要とする場合に最適です。特に、28-Day Metabolic Resetプラットフォーム向けです。","ko":"관리 에이전트가 팀 및 로스터 관리의 고급 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. 특히 28-Day Metabolic Reset 플랫폼을 위한 것입니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Administrativos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de equipo y roster para la plataforma de 28-Day Metabolic Reset.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents administratifs ayant besoin de capacités avancées de gestion d''équipe et de roster pour la plateforme de 28-Day Metabolic Reset.","de":"Perfekt für Administrative Agenten, die erweiterte Team- und Roster-Management-Funktionen für die 28-Day Metabolic Reset-Plattform benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Administrativos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de equipe e escalação para a plataforma 28-Day Metabolic Reset.","ru":"Идеально подходит для административных агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности управления командой и расписанием для платформы 28-Day Metabolic Reset.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإداريين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة الفريق والموظفين من أجل منصة 28-Day Metabolic Reset."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose and fix team vs recruits index discrepancies, ensuring accurate user and facilitator data through dry-run diagnostics and automated fixes using JSON input handling and roster verification protocols.","zh":"赋予代理诊断和修复团队与招募索引不符问题的能力，通过dry-run诊断和使用JSON输入处理以及名单验证协议实现用户和促进者数据的准确性。","ja":"エージェントがチームとリクルートのインデックスの不一致を診断および修復できるようにし、dry-run診断とJSON入力処理およびロースター検証プロトコルを使用して、ユーザーとファシリテーターのデータの正確性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 팀과 모집 인덱스의 불일치를 진단하고 수정할 수 있도록 하여 dry-run 진단 및 JSON 입력 처리 및 로스터 검증 프로토콜을 사용하여 사용자 및.facilitator 데이터의 정확성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diagnosticar y solucionar discrepancias entre el índice de equipo y reclutas, garantizando datos precisos de usuario y facilitador a través de diagnósticos de prueba y soluciones automáticas utilizando el manejo de entrada JSON y protocolos de verificación de roster.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer et de corriger les écarts entre l''indice d''équipe et les recrues, garantissant des données précises pour les utilisateurs et les facilitateurs grâce à des diagnostics de test et à des corrections automatiques utilisant le traitement d''entrée JSON et les protocoles de vérification de roster.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Abweichungen zwischen Team- und Rekrutenindex zu diagnostizieren und zu beheben, indem sie genaue Benutzer- und Facilitatordaten durch Trockendiagnostik und automatisierte Korrekturen unter Verwendung von JSON-Eingabehandling und Roster-Überprüfungsprotokollen sicherstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a diagnosticar e corrigir discrepâncias no índice de equipe vs recrutas, garantindo dados precisos de usuário e facilitador por meio de diagnósticos de teste seco e correções automatizadas usando manipulação de entrada JSON e protocolos de verificação de escalação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью диагностировать и исправлять несоответствия индекса команды и рекрутов, обеспечивая точность данных пользователей и фасилитаторов посредством тестирования на сухую и автоматических исправлений с помощью обработки входных данных JSON и протоколов проверки расписания.","ar":"يُمكن الوكلاء من تشخيص وأصلاح الانتحالات في فهرس الفريق والمجندين، مما يضمن دقة بيانات المستخدم والمنسق من خلال تشخيص الاختبار الجاف والتصحيحات الآلية باستخدام معالجة الإدخال JSON وبروتوكولات التحقق من الجدول الزمني."},"useCases":{"en":["Diagnosing team roster discrepancies","Automating team index reconciliations","Verifying user and facilitator data integrity"],"zh":["诊断团队名单不符问题","自动化团队索引调和","验证用户和促进者数据完整性"],"ja":["チームロースターの不一致を診断する","チームインデックスの調和を自動化する","ユーザーとファシリテーターのデータの完全性を検証する"],"ko":["팀 로스터 불일치를 진단하기","팀 인덱스 조정을 자동화하기","사용자 및.facilitator 데이터의 무결성을 검증하기"],"es":["Diagnosticar discrepancias en el roster del equipo","Automatizar la reconciliación de índices de equipo","Verificar la integridad de los datos de usuario y facilitador"],"fr":["Diagnostiquer les écarts dans le roster d''équipe","Automatiser la réconciliation des indexes d''équipe","Vérifier l''intégrité des données des utilisateurs et des facilitateurs"],"de":["Diagnostizieren von Abweichungen im Team-Roster","Automatisieren der Team-Indexabgleich","Überprüfen der Integrität von Benutzer- und Facilitatordaten"],"pt":["Diagnosticar discrepâncias na escalação da equipe","Automatizar a reconciliação do índice da equipe","Verificar a integridade dos dados do usuário e do facilitador"],"ru":["Диагностика несоответствий в расписании команды","Автоматизация согласования индекса команды","Проверка целостности данных пользователей и фасилитаторов"],"ar":["تشخيص الانتحالات في جدول الفريق","أتمتة متابعة فهرس الفريق","التحقق من سلامة بيانات المستخدم والمنسق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to 28-Day Metabolic Reset platform data","Limited to team and roster management functionality"],"zh":["需要访问28-Day Metabolic Reset平台数据","仅限于团队和名单管理功能"],"ja":["28-Day Metabolic Resetプラットフォームのデータへのアクセスが必要","チームおよびロースター管理機能のみに限定"],"ko":["28-Day Metabolic Reset 플랫폼 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요","팀 및 로스터 관리 기능에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los datos de la plataforma de 28-Day Metabolic Reset","Limitado a la funcionalidad de gestión de equipo y roster"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données de la plateforme de 28-Day Metabolic Reset","Limité à la fonctionnalité de gestion d''équipe et de roster"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Daten der 28-Day Metabolic Reset-Plattform","Begrenzt auf Team- und Roster-Management-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos dados da plataforma 28-Day Metabolic Reset","Limitado à funcionalidade de gerenciamento de equipe e escalação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным платформы 28-Day Metabolic Reset","Ограничен функциональностью управления командой и расписанием"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات منصة 28-Day Metabolic Reset","محدود بالوظيفة الإدارية للفريق والموظفين"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4b54256f34aca6c86dbcac0c27f2d3b26abd5c862372093ac5215f6215310524","qualityScore":60}');
