INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Develonaut/bnto/pickup', 'pickup', 'Develonaut', 'bnto', 'community', 'pickup Develonaut bnto community The pickup skill utilizes a two-phase task execution workflow, researching and proposing tasks before executing upon user approval, benefiting developers and AI agents alike. Pickup 技术采用两阶段任务执行流程，包括提案和执行阶段，确保任务的高效执行 Pickup スキルは二相タスク実行を採用し、提案と実行の 2 つの段階でタスクを最適化します Pickup 기능은 2단계 작업 실행 프로세스를 사용하여 작업을 효율적으로 실행합니다 El skill pickup utiliza un flujo de trabajo de propuesta y ejecución para la ejecución de tareas en dos fases. Proporciona una propuesta y ejecuta solo después de la aprobación del usuario. Le skill pickup utilise un flux de travail de proposition et d''exécution pour l''exécution de tâches en deux phases. Il fournit une proposition et exécute uniquement après l''approbation de l''utilisateur. Der pickup-Skill verwendet einen Arbeitsablauf aus Vorschlag und Ausführung für die Ausführung von Aufgaben in zwei Phasen. Er stellt einen Vorschlag bereit und führt nur nach Benutzerzustimmung aus. O pickup é uma habilidade que utiliza um fluxo de trabalho proposto e executado em duas fases, garantindo a aprovação do usuário antes da execução. Pickup - это навык, использующий двуфазный рабочий процесс, обеспечивающий одобрение пользователя перед выполнением задач ИИ Агентов. Pickup هو مهارة تستخدم تدفق عمل مقترح وتنفيذي على مرحلتين، مما يضمن موافقة المستخدم قبل التنفيذ لآلات الإيضاح. how to use pickup pickup skill two-phase task execution task management workflow pickup vs other AI agents pickup setup guide pickup install what is pickup pickup alternative pickup workflow Pickup 技术 两阶段任务执行 任务管理优化 AI 工具 任务自动化 工作流优化 Utilizes a propose-then-execute workflow for task management Executes tasks in two phases: research and proposal, and execution upon user approval Checks the landscape for conflicts before task execution Presents a proposal for user approval before task execution Supports a deterministic approach to task execution pickup is a skill that implements a propose-then-execute workflow for efficient task execution and conflict resolution.');
