"Sweep Issuesは、開発生命周期における問題管理と最適化を自動化するAIエージェントです","ko":"Sweep Issues는 개발 생명주기에서 문제 관리와 최적화를 자동화하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"Sweep-issues es una herramienta de auditoría de calidad de backlog que ayuda a evaluar y priorizar problemas en proyectos de desarrollo","fr":"Sweep-issues est un outil d''audit de qualité de backlog qui aide à évaluer et à prioriser les problèmes dans les projets de développement","de":"Sweep-issues ist ein Tool zur Qualitätsprüfung von Backlogs, das dabei hilft, Probleme in Entwicklungsprojekten zu bewerten und zu priorisieren","pt":"O Sweep Issues é uma ferramenta de auditoria de qualidade de issues que ajuda a identificar e priorizar tarefas que precisam de refinamento","ru":"Sweep Issues — это инструмент аудита качества задач, который помогает выявить и расставить приоритеты задач, требующих доработки","ar":"Sweep Issues هو أداة تدقيق جودة المسائل التي تساعد على تحديد وتحديد الأولوية للمهام التي تحتاج إلى تحسين"},"features":{"en":["Evaluates open issues against a gold-standard quality checklist","Surfaces issues that need work for team prioritization","Supports label filters as arguments, such as `/sweep-issues feature`","Allows phase-based filtering, e.g., `/sweep-issues phase:2`","Automates the development lifecycle for streamlined workflows"],"zh":["自动化开发生命周期","问题管理和优化","支持标签过滤","CLI命令行接口","优化项目质量和效率"],"ja":["プロジェクトを自動化","問題管理と最適化","ラベルフィルタリングをサポート","CLIコマンドラインインターフェース","品質と効率を向上"],"ko":["프로젝트 자동화 개발 생명주기","문제 관리와 최적화","레이블 필터링 지원","CLI 명령줄 인터페이스","품질과 효율성을 높임"],"es":["Evaluación de problemas abiertos contra una lista de verificación de calidad","Filtrado de problemas por etiquetas o fases de desarrollo","Automatización del ciclo de vida de desarrollo de proyectos","Mejora de la eficiencia en la resolución de problemas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes"],"fr":["Évaluation des problèmes ouverts contre une liste de vérification de qualité","Filtrage des problèmes par étiquettes ou phases de développement","Automatisation du cycle de vie de développement de projets","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans la résolution de problèmes","Intégration avec les outils de développement existants"],"de":["Überprüfung offener Probleme gegen eine Qualitätsprüfliste","Filtern von Problemen nach Labels oder Entwicklungsphasen","Automatisierung des Entwicklungslebenszyklus von Projekten","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der Problemlösung","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Auditoria de qualidade de issues com base em uma lista de verificação de qualidade","Filtragem de issues por etiquetas ou fases","Identificação de issues que precisam de refinamento","Priorização de issues para refinamento","Integração com o ciclo de desenvolvimento autônomo"],"ru":["Аудит качества задач на основе чек-листа качества","Фильтрация задач по меткам или фазам","Выявление задач, требующих доработки","Расстановка приоритетов задач для доработки","Интеграция с автономным циклом разработки"],"ar":["تدقيق جودة المسائل على أساس قائمة تدقيق جودة","تصفية المسائل حسب العلامات أو المراحل","تحديد المسائل التي تحتاج إلى تحسين","تحديد الأولوية للمسائل لتحسينها","التكامل مع دورة التطوير الذاتي الكاملة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use sweep-issues","sweep-issues setup guide","autonomous development lifecycle","issue triage tools","sweep-issues vs competing tools","sweep-issues install","what is sweep-issues","sweep-issues alternative","sweep-issues tutorial"],"zh":["Sweep Issues","AIエージェント","自动化开发生命周期","问题管理","优化","CLI","项目自动化","效率优化"],"ja":["Sweep Issues","AIエージェント","プロジェクト自動化","問題管理","最適化","CLI","開発生命周期","効率向上"],"ko":["Sweep Issues","AI 에이전트","프로젝트 자동화 개발 생명주기","문제 관리","최적화","CLI","프로젝트 자동화","효율성 향상"],"es":["herramientas de desarrollo","auditoría de calidad","ciclo de vida de desarrollo","automatización de proyectos","resolución de problemas","desarrollo de software","Agente de IA para desarrollo","Herramientas de desarrollo autónomo"],"fr":["outils de développement","audit de qualité","cycle de vie de développement","automatisation de projets","résolution de problèmes","développement de logiciels","Agent IA pour développement","Outils de développement autonome"],"de":["Entwicklungstools","Qualitätsprüfung","Entwicklungslebenszyklus","Automatisierung von Projekten","Problemlösung","Software-Entwicklung","KI-Agent für Entwicklung","Tools für autonome Entwicklung"],"pt":["Sweep Issues","auditoria de qualidade de issues","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","ciclo de desenvolvimento autônomo","gestão de projetos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de software","ИИ Агенты","ferramentas de auditoria de qualidade"],"ru":["Sweep Issues","аудит качества задач","инструмент разработки","автономный цикл разработки","управление проектами","инструменты разработки программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты","инструменты аудита качества"],"ar":["Sweep Issues","تدقيق جودة المسائل","أداة تطوير","دورة التطوير الذاتي الكاملة","إدارة المشاريع","أدوات تطوير البرمجيات","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تدقيق الجودة"]}},"owner":"rnwolfe","repo":"forge","repoPath":"rnwolfe/forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T17:51:36Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sweep-issues","description":"Sweep open issues against the quality checklist and label those needing refinement","bodyPreview":"# Sweep Issues — Backlog Quality Audit\n\nYou are a disciplined issue triager. Your job is to evaluate open issues against the\ngold-standard quality checklist and surface those that need work, so the team can\nprioritize refinement.\n\n## Input\n\nThe user may provide a label filter as an argument: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\nExamples:\n- `/sweep-issues` — sweep all open issues\n- `/sweep-issues feature` — only sweep issues labeled `feature`\n- `/sweep-issues phase:2` — only sweep issues in phase 2\n\n## Process\n\n### 1.","body":"# Sweep Issues — Backlog Quality Audit\n\nYou are a disciplined issue triager. Your job is to evaluate open issues against the\ngold-standard quality checklist and surface those that need work, so the team can\nprioritize refinement.\n\n## Input\n\nThe user may provide a label filter as an argument: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\nExamples:\n- `/sweep-issues` — sweep all open issues\n- `/sweep-issues feature` — only sweep issues labeled `feature`\n- `/sweep-issues phase:2` — only sweep issues in phase 2\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Read Project Configuration\n\nRead `forge.toml` for the repo path used in `gh` commands.\n\n### 2. Read the Quality Bar\n\nRead the gold-standard template and checklist:\n\n`.claude/skills/shared/issue-quality-checklist.md`\n\nThe 10-item checklist is your scoring rubric:\n1. Summary\n2. Scope (features/commands)\n3. Architecture\n4. Integration\n5. Acceptance criteria\n6. Edge cases\n7. Tests\n8. Documentation\n9. CLAUDE.md update\n10. Labels\n\n### 3. Fetch Open Issues\n\nFetch the issue list:\n\n```bash\ngh issue list --repo $REPO --state open --limit 100 --json number,title,labels,body\n```\n\nIf the user provided a label filter, add `--label \"<filter>\"` to narrow the set.\n\nAfter fetching, manually filter out issues that already have `backlog/needs-refinement` or\n`backlog/ready` labels — these are already in the pipeline.\n\n### 4. Assess Each Issue\n\nFor each remaining issue, score it against the 10-item checklist. Rate each item as:\n\n- **Present**: The section exists and meets the bar\n- **Weak**: The section exists but needs improvement\n- **Missing**: The section is absent entirely\n\n**Adapt the checklist to the issue type:**\n- Bug reports: skip Features table, Architecture can be lighter\n- Small enhancements: skip Architecture if the scope is a single function change\n- Feature requests: all 10 items apply\n\nCount a score as: Present = 1, Weak = 0.5, Missing = 0. Total out of 10 (or the\napplicable subset for the issue type).\n\nAssign a verdict:\n- **Ready** (8+/10): Already meets the bar — suggest `backlog/ready` label\n- **Needs refinement** (4-7.5/10): Has gaps worth filling\n- **Stub** (<4/10): Needs significant work\n\n### 5. Present Summary Table\n\nShow the user a table like:\n\n```\nBacklog sweep — 12 issues evaluated\n\n  #   Title                              Score  Verdict\n  35  Feature X                          9/10   Ready\n  42  Enhancement Y                      5/10   Needs refinement\n  48  Better error messages              3/10   Stub\n  51  New API endpoint                   6/10   Needs refinement\n  ...\n\nSummary: 2 ready, 6 need refinement, 4 stubs\n```\n\nFor issues verdicted as \"Needs refinement\" or \"Stub\", list the top 2-3 missing/weak\nitems so the user knows what gaps to fill.\n\n### 6. Apply Labels (With Approval)\n\nAsk the user which actions to take:\n- Apply `backlog/needs-refinement` label to issues verdicted as \"Needs refinement\" or \"Stub\"\n- Optionally post a comment on each labeled issue listing the specific gaps found\n- Suggest `backlog/ready` for issues that already meet the bar\n\n**Always ask for explicit approval before modifying any issues.**\n\nAfter approval, apply labels:\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit $ISSUE_NUMBER --repo $REPO --add-label \"backlog/needs-refinement\"\n```\n\nIf the user opted for gap comments:\n\n```bash\ngh issue comment $ISSUE_NUMBER --repo $REPO --body \"<gap listing>\"\n```\n\n### 7. Report Results\n\nPrint a results summary:\n\n```\nSweep complete:\n  - 2 issues already meet the bar (suggested backlog/ready)\n  - 6 issues labeled backlog/needs-refinement\n  - 4 stubs labeled backlog/needs-refinement\n\nNext step: run /refine-issue to start improving the highest-priority issues.\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Non-destructive.** Only add labels and comments. Never remove labels, edit issue\n  bodies, or close issues. The sweep is read-heavy, write-light.\n- **Adapt the checklist.** A bug report with clear repro steps and expected behavior\n  might score 8/10 even without a Features table. Don''t penalize issues for skipping\n  sections that don''t apply to their type.\n- **Be efficient.** For large backlogs, summarize rather than showing per-item breakdowns\n  for every issue. Only show detailed gaps for issues the user is likely to act on.\n- **Suggest `backlog/ready` generously.** If an issue is close to the bar and the gaps are\n  minor (e.g., missing CLAUDE.md update note), say so — the user may want to quickly\n  patch it rather than going through full refinement.\n- **Batch sensibly.** If there are 50+ issues, process them in batches and let the user\n  decide whether to continue.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:13:32.874Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing autonomous issue triage and refinement prioritization.","zh":"非常适合需要自主问题分诊和优先级细化的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自律的に問題の分類と優先順位の細分化を行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"자율적인 문제 분류 및 우선 순위 세분화가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una triage y priorización de refinamiento de problemas autónomos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une triage et de priorisation de raffinement de problèmes autonomes.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine autonome Problemtriage und Raffinierungs-Priorisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de triagem autônoma de problemas e priorização de refinamento.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима автономная сортировка проблем и определение приоритетности уточнения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيون الذين يحتاجون إلى فرز قضايا مستقل وتحديد الأولوية لتحسين الجودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate open issues against a gold-standard quality checklist, surface those needing refinement, and prioritize them using label filters and phase-based sorting, leveraging protocols like issue labeling and filtering.","zh":"赋予代理评估开放问题与黄金标准质量检查清单，找出需要完善的问题，并使用标签过滤器和基于阶段的排序对其进行优先级排序，利用诸如问题标签和过滤等协议。","ja":"エージェントがオープンな問題を黄金標準の品質チェックリストに評価し、改良が必要な問題を特定し、ラベルフィルタとフェーズベースのソートを使用して優先順位を付けることができます。問題ラベル付けやフィルタリングなどのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 오픈 이슈를 금준표준 품질 체크리스트에 평가하고, 개선이 필요한 이슈를 식별하고, 레이블 필터와 단계 기반 정렬을 사용하여 우선 순위를 지정할 수 있습니다. 문제 레이블 지정 및 필터링과 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar problemas abiertos contra una lista de verificación de calidad de referencia, mostrar aquellos que necesitan refinamiento y priorizarlos utilizando filtros de etiquetas y clasificación basada en fases, aprovechando protocolos como etiquetado de problemas y filtrado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer les problèmes ouverts contre une liste de contrôle de qualité de référence, de mettre en surface ceux qui nécessitent un raffinement et de les prioriser en utilisant des filtres d''étiquettes et un tri basé sur les phases, en exploitant des protocoles tels que l''étiquetage des problèmes et le filtrage.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, offene Probleme gegen eine Gold-Standard-Qualitätsprüfliste zu bewerten, diejenigen zu identifizieren, die ein Raffinieren benötigen, und diese mithilfe von Label-Filtern und phasenbasiertem Sortieren zu priorisieren, wobei Protokolle wie Problemetikettierung und -filterung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar problemas abertos contra uma lista de controle de qualidade padrão, mostrar aqueles que precisam de refinamento e priorizá-los usando filtros de etiquetas e ordenação baseada em fases, utilizando protocolos como etiquetagem de problemas e filtragem.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценить открытые проблемы по сравнению с эталонным списком качества, выявить те, которые требуют уточнения, и расставить приоритеты с помощью фильтров меток и сортировки на основе фаз, используя протоколы, такие как маркировка и фильтрация проблем.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم القضايا المفتوحة ضد قائمة مرجعية للجودة، وتصدر تلك التي تحتاج إلى تحسين الجودة وتحديد الأولويات باستخدام مرشحات التصنيف والفرز القائم على المراحل، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تصنيف القضايا والتصفية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue triage for streamlined development workflows","Prioritizing issue refinement based on label filters","Debugging issue backlogs using phase-based analysis"],"zh":["自动化问题分诊以实现开发工作流的简化","基于标签过滤器的问题完善优先级","使用基于阶段的分析进行问题积压调试"],"ja":["開発ワークフローを簡素化するための問題のトリアージの自動化","ラベルフィルタを使用した問題の改良の優先順位付け","フェーズベースの分析を使用した問題バックログのデバッグ"],"ko":["開発 워크플로우를 간소화하기 위한 문제 분류의 자동화","레이블 필터를 사용한 문제 개선의 우선 순위 지정","단계 기반 분석을 사용한 문제 백로그 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la triage de problemas para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo optimizados","Priorizar el refinamiento de problemas en función de filtros de etiquetas","Depurar las reservas de problemas mediante análisis basado en fases"],"fr":["Automatiser la triage des problèmes pour des flux de travail de développement rationalisés","Prioriser le raffinement des problèmes en fonction de filtres d''étiquettes","Déboguer les réserves de problèmes à l''aide d''une analyse basée sur les phases"],"de":["Automatisierung der Problemtriage für optimierte Entwicklungswerkflüsse","Priorisierung der Problemeraffinierung basierend auf Label-Filtern","Fehlerbehebung von Problemrückständen mithilfe phasenbasierter Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar a triagem de problemas para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento otimizados","Priorizar a refinamento de problemas com base em filtros de etiquetas","Depurar filas de problemas usando análise baseada em fases"],"ru":["Автоматизация сортировки проблем для оптимизированных потоков разработки","Определение приоритетности уточнения проблем на основе фильтров меток","Отладка очередей проблем с помощью фазовой аналитики"],"ar":["أتمتة فرز القضايا من أجل عمليات عمل متدفقة ومحسنة","تحديد الأولوية لتحسين القضايا بناءً على مرشحات التصنيف","تصحيح مشاكل القضايا باستخدام تحليل قائم على المراحل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to issue tracking system","Limited to issue refinement prioritization"],"zh":["需要访问问题跟踪系统","仅限于问题完善优先级"],"ja":["問題トラッキングシステムへのアクセスが必要","問題の改良の優先順位付けに限定される"],"ko":["문제 추적 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","문제 개선의 우선 순위 지정에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de seguimiento de problemas","Limitado a la priorización de refinamiento de problemas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de suivi des problèmes","Limité à la priorisation du raffinement des problèmes"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Problemsystem","Begrenzt auf die Priorisierung der Problemeraffinierung"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de rastreamento de problemas","Limitado à priorização de refinamento de problemas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к системе отслеживания проблем","Ограничен определением приоритетности уточнения проблем"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام تتبع القضايا","محدود بتحديد الأولوية لتحسين القضايا"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"115103cd4a1e1f7d20f4a55ed6d3a12c5274365d28daab20e27d7671f62bb415","qualityScore":60}');
