INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('rnwolfe/forge/sweep-issues', 'sweep-issues', 'rnwolfe', 'forge', 'community', 'sweep-issues rnwolfe forge community The sweep-issues skill bootstraps any project with a full autonomous development lifecycle, helping disciplined issue triagers evaluate open issues and prioritize refinement. It benefits development teams seeking to streamline their workflow. Sweep Issues是一种AIエージェント，能够自动化开发生命周期，优化项目质量和效率 Sweep Issuesは、プロジェクトを自動化し、品質と効率を向上させるAIエージェントです Sweep Issues는 프로젝트 자동화 개발 생명주기를 개선하고 효율성을 높이는 AI 에이전트입니다 Sweep-issues es una herramienta que permite automatizar el ciclo de vida de desarrollo de proyectos, evaluando problemas abiertos contra una lista de verificación de calidad Sweep-issues est un outil qui permet d''automatiser le cycle de vie de développement de projets, en évaluant les problèmes ouverts contre une liste de vérification de qualité Sweep-issues ist ein Tool, das die Automatisierung des Entwicklungslebenszyklus von Projekten ermöglicht, indem es offene Probleme gegen eine Qualitätsprüfliste überprüft O Sweep Issues é uma ferramenta que ajuda a garantir a qualidade do backlog de projetos, realizando uma auditoria de qualidade de issues e identificando aquelas que precisam de refinamento. Sweep Issues — это инструмент, который помогает обеспечить качество бэклога проектов, проводя аудит качества задач и выявляя те, которые требуют доработки. Sweep Issues هو أداة تساعد على ضمان جودة قائمة انتظار المشاريع، من خلال إجراء تدقيق جودة للمسائل وتحديد تلك التي تحتاج إلى تحسين. how to use sweep-issues sweep-issues setup guide autonomous development lifecycle issue triage tools sweep-issues vs competing tools sweep-issues install what is sweep-issues sweep-issues alternative sweep-issues tutorial Sweep Issues AIエージェント 自动化开发生命周期 问题管理 优化 CLI 项目自动化 效率优化 Evaluates open issues against a gold-standard quality checklist Surfaces issues that need work for team prioritization Supports label filters as arguments, such as `/sweep-issues feature` Allows phase-based filtering, e.g., `/sweep-issues phase:2` Automates the development lifecycle for streamlined workflows sweep-issues is a skill that automates the development lifecycle by evaluating open issues against a gold-standard quality checklist and surfacing those that need work.');
