M、SOMを計算すること","ko":"스타트업 비즈니스 분석 시장 기회는 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 시장 기회를 분석하고, TAM, SAM, SOM을 계산하는 것을 의미합니다","es":"Un análisis de oportunidades de mercado es un proceso que utiliza metodologías ascendentes y descendentes para calcular el tamaño del mercado","fr":"Une analyse des opportunités de marché est un processus qui utilise des méthodologies ascendantes et descendantes pour calculer la taille du marché","de":"Eine Marktoportunitätsanalyse ist ein Prozess, der Aufwärts- und Abwärtsmethoden verwendet, um die Marktgroesse zu berechnen","pt":"Análise de oportunidade de mercado é um processo que ajuda as startups a entender seu mercado-alvo","ru":"Анализ возможностей рынка - это процесс, который помогает стартапам понять свою целевую аудиторию","ar":"تحليل فرص السوق هو عملية تساعد الشركات الناشئة على فهم سوقها المستهدف"},"features":{"en":["Generates Total Addressable Market (TAM) calculations using bottom-up and top-down methodologies","Calculates Serviceable Available Market (SAM) to identify potential customer segments","Determines Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM) to estimate realistic market share","Provides guidance on market opportunity analysis tasks and workflows","Offers best practices and checklists for market opportunity analysis"],"zh":["总可寻址市场（TAM）计算","可服务可用市场（SAM）计算","可服务可获得市场（SOM）计算","底向上方法计算","顶向下方法计算"],"ja":["総アドレス可能市場（TAM）計算","サービス可能利用可能市場（SAM）計算","サービス可能取得可能市場（SOM）計算","ボトムアップ方法計算","トップダウン方法計算"],"ko":["총 주소 가능 시장 (TAM) 계산","서비스 가능 사용 가능 시장 (SAM) 계산","서비스 가능 획득 가능 시장 (SOM) 계산","하향식 방법 계산","상향식 방법 계산"],"es":["Cálculos de Total Addressable Market (TAM)","Cálculos de Serviceable Available Market (SAM)","Cálculos de Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)","Metodologías ascendentes y descendentes","Análisis de oportunidades de mercado para startups","Guía para tareas de análisis de oportunidades de mercado"],"fr":["Calculs de Total Addressable Market (TAM)","Calculs de Serviceable Available Market (SAM)","Calculs de Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)","Méthodologies ascendantes et descendantes","Analyse des opportunités de marché pour les startups","Guide pour les tâches d''analyse des opportunités de marché"],"de":["Berechnungen von Total Addressable Market (TAM)","Berechnungen von Serviceable Available Market (SAM)","Berechnungen von Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)","Aufwärts- und Abwärtsmethoden","Marktoportunitätsanalyse für Startups","Leitfaden für Marktoportunitätsanalyse-Aufgaben"],"pt":["Cálculos de Total Addressable Market (TAM)","Cálculos de Serviceable Available Market (SAM)","Cálculos de Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)","Metodologias bottom-up e top-down","Análise de mercado para startups","Otimização de estratégias de mercado"],"ru":["Расчеты Total Addressable Market (TAM)","Расчеты Serviceable Available Market (SAM)","Расчеты Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)","Методологии bottom-up и top-down","Анализ рынка для стартапов","Оптимизация стратегий рынка с помощью ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["حسابات السوق الكلية القابلة للتحويل (TAM)","حسابات السوق المتاح القابل للخدمة (SAM)","حسابات السوق القابل للخدمة القابل للتحقيق (SOM)","منهجيات من الأسفل إلى الأعلى ومن الأعلى إلى الأسفل","تحليل السوق للشركات الناشئة","تحسين استراتيجيات السوق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use startup-business-analyst-market-opportunity","what is startup-business-analyst-market-opportunity","startup-business-analyst-market-opportunity alternative","startup-business-analyst-market-opportunity vs competitor","startup-business-analyst-market-opportunity install","startup-business-analyst-market-opportunity setup guide","market opportunity analysis for startups","TAM SAM SOM calculations","startup business analyst tools"],"zh":["启动商业分析市场机会","AI工具市场分析","TAM计算","SAM计算","SOM计算","市场机会分析"],"ja":["スタートアップビジネスアナリスト市場機会","AIエージェント市場分析","TAM計算","SAM計算","SOM計算","市場機会分析"],"ko":["스타트업 비즈니스 분석 시장 기회","AI 에이전트 시장 분석","TAM 계산","SAM 계산","SOM 계산","시장 기회 분석"],"es":["análisis de oportunidades de mercado","Total Addressable Market","Serviceable Available Market","Serviceable Obtainable Market","metodologías ascendentes y descendentes","startups","Agentes de IA","herramientas de análisis de mercado","guía de análisis de oportunidades de mercado"],"fr":["analyse des opportunités de marché","Total Addressable Market","Serviceable Available Market","Serviceable Obtainable Market","méthodologies ascendantes et descendantes","startups","Outils d''IA","outils d''analyse de marché","guide d''analyse des opportunités de marché"],"de":["Marktoportunitätsanalyse","Total Addressable Market","Serviceable Available Market","Serviceable Obtainable Market","Aufwärts- und Abwärtsmethoden","Startups","KI-Tools","Marktanalyse-Tools","Leitfaden für Marktoportunitätsanalyse"],"pt":["análise de oportunidade de mercado","TAM","SAM","SOM","metodologias de análise de mercado","startups","estratégias de mercado","otimização de mercado","ferramentas de análise de mercado"],"ru":["анализ возможностей рынка","TAM","SAM","SOM","методологии анализа рынка","стартапы","стратегии рынка","оптимизация рынка","инструменты анализа рынка","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تحليل فرص السوق","TAM","SAM","SOM","منهجيات تحليل السوق","الشركات الناشئة","استراتيجيات السوق","تحسين السوق","أدوات تحليل السوق"]}},"owner":"lucasdreger","repo":"restaurant","repoPath":"lucasdreger/restaurant","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:31:55Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"startup-business-analyst-market-opportunity","description":"Generate comprehensive market opportunity analysis with TAM/SAM/SOM","bodyPreview":"# Market Opportunity Analysis\n\nGenerate a comprehensive market opportunity analysis for a startup, including Total Addressable Market (TAM), Serviceable Available Market (SAM), and Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM) calculations using both bottom-up and top-down methodologies.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on market opportunity analysis tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for market opportunity analysis\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelate","body":"# Market Opportunity Analysis\n\nGenerate a comprehensive market opportunity analysis for a startup, including Total Addressable Market (TAM), Serviceable Available Market (SAM), and Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM) calculations using both bottom-up and top-down methodologies.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on market opportunity analysis tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for market opportunity analysis\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to market opportunity analysis\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## What This Command Does\n\nThis command guides through an interactive market sizing process to:\n1. Define the target market and customer segments\n2. Gather relevant market data\n3. Calculate TAM using bottom-up methodology\n4. Validate with top-down analysis\n5. Narrow to SAM with appropriate filters\n6. Estimate realistic SOM (3-5 year opportunity)\n7. Present findings in a formatted report\n\n## Instructions for Claude\n\nWhen this command is invoked, follow these steps:\n\n### Step 1: Gather Context\n\nAsk the user for essential information:\n- **Product/Service Description:** What problem is being solved?\n- **Target Customers:** Who is the ideal customer? (industry, size, geography)\n- **Business Model:** How does pricing work? (subscription, transaction, etc.)\n- **Stage:** What stage is the company? (pre-launch, seed, Series A)\n- **Geography:** Initial target market (US, North America, Global)\n\n### Step 2: Activate market-sizing-analysis Skill\n\nThe market-sizing-analysis skill provides comprehensive methodologies. Reference it for:\n- Bottom-up calculation frameworks\n- Top-down validation approaches\n- Industry-specific templates\n- Data source recommendations\n\n### Step 3: Conduct Bottom-Up Analysis\n\n**For B2B/SaaS:**\n1. Define customer segments (company size, industry, use case)\n2. Estimate number of companies in each segment\n3. Determine average contract value (ACV) per segment\n4. Calculate TAM: Σ (Segment Size × ACV)\n\n**For Consumer/Marketplace:**\n1. Define target user demographics\n2. Estimate total addressable users\n3. Determine average revenue per user (ARPU)\n4. Calculate TAM: Total Users × ARPU × Frequency\n\n**For Transactions/E-commerce:**\n1. Estimate total transaction volume (GMV)\n2. Determine take rate or margin\n3. Calculate TAM: Total GMV × Take Rate\n\n### Step 4: Gather Market Data\n\nUse available tools to research:\n- **WebSearch:** Find industry reports, market size estimates, public company data\n- **Cite all sources** with URLs and publication dates\n- **Document assumptions** clearly\n\nRecommended data sources (from skill):\n- Government data (Census, BLS)\n- Industry reports (Gartner, Forrester, Statista)\n- Public company filings (10-K reports)\n- Trade associations\n- Academic research\n\n### Step 5: Top-Down Validation\n\nValidate bottom-up calculation:\n1. Find total market category size from research\n2. Apply geographic filters\n3. Apply segment/product filters\n4. Compare to bottom-up TAM (should be within 30%)\n\nIf variance > 30%, investigate and explain differences.\n\n### Step 6: Calculate SAM\n\nApply realistic filters to narrow TAM:\n- **Geographic:** Regions actually serviceable\n- **Product Capability:** Features needed to serve\n- **Market Readiness:** Customers ready to adopt\n- **Addressable Switching:** Can reach and convert\n\nFormula:\n```\nSAM = TAM × Geographic % × Product Fit % × Market Readiness %\n```\n\n### Step 7: Estimate SOM\n\nCalculate realistic obtainable market share:\n\n**Conservative Approach (Recommended):**\n- Year 3: 2-3% of SAM\n- Year 5: 4-6% of SAM\n\n**Consider:**\n- Competitive intensity\n- Available resources (funding, team)\n- Go-to-market effectiveness\n- Differentiation strength\n\n### Step 8: Create Market Sizing Report\n\nGenerate a comprehensive markdown report with:\n\n**Section 1: Executive Summary**\n- Market opportunity in one paragraph\n- TAM/SAM/SOM headline numbers\n\n**Section 2: Market Definition**\n- Problem being solved\n- Target customer profile\n- Geographic scope\n- Time horizon\n\n**Section 3: Bottom-Up Analysis**\n- Customer segment breakdown\n- Segment sizing with sources\n- TAM calculation with formula\n- Assumptions documented\n\n**Section 4: Top-Down Validation**\n- Industry category and size\n- Filter application\n- Validated TAM\n- Comparison to bottom-up\n\n**Section 5: SAM Calculation**\n- Filters applied with rationale\n- SAM formula and result\n- Segment-level breakdown\n\n**Section 6: SOM Projection**\n- Market share assumptions\n- Year 3 and Year 5 estimates\n- Customer count implications\n- Revenue projections\n\n**Section 7: Market Growth**\n- Industry growth rate (CAGR)\n- Key growth drivers\n- 5-year market evolution\n\n**Section 8: Validation and Sanity Checks**\n- Public company comparisons\n- Customer count validation\n- Competitive context\n\n**Section 9: Investment Thesis**\n- Market opportunity assessment\n- Key positives and risks\n- Venture-scale potential\n- Next steps\n\n### Step 9: Save Report\n\nOffer to save the report as a markdown file:\n- Suggest filename: `market-opportunity-analysis-YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- Use Write tool to create file\n- Confirm file location with user\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n**Do:**\n- Start with bottom-up (most credible)\n- Always triangulate with top-down\n- Cite all data sources\n- Document every assumption\n- Be conservative on SOM\n- Compare to public company benchmarks\n- Explain any data gaps or limitations\n\n**Don''t:**\n- Rely solely on top-down\n- Cherry-pick optimistic data\n- Claim >10% SOM without strong justification\n- Mix methodologies inappropriately\n- Ignore competitive context\n- Skip validation steps\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```\nUser: /market-opportunity\n\nClaude: I''ll help you create a comprehensive market opportunity analysis. Let me start by gathering some context.\n\nWhat product or service are you analyzing?\n→ \"AI-powered email marketing for e-commerce companies\"\n\nWho are your target customers?\n→ \"E-commerce companies with $1M+ annual revenue in North America\"\n\nWhat''s your pricing model?\n→ \"Subscription: $50-500/month based on email volume, average $300/month\"\n\n[Claude proceeds with analysis, gathering data, calculating TAM/SAM/SOM, and generating report]\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Commands\n\nThis command pairs well with:\n- `/financial-projections` - Use SOM to build revenue model\n- `/business-case` - Include market sizing in business case\n\n## Notes\n\n- Market sizing typically takes 30-60 minutes for thorough analysis\n- Quality depends on data availability - explain limitations\n- Update annually as market evolves\n- Conservative estimates build credibility with investors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:14:45.264Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Business Intelligence Agents requiring advanced market analysis capabilities, including Total Addressable Market (TAM), Serviceable Available Market (SAM), and Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM) calculations.","zh":"适合需要高级市场分析能力的商业智能代理，包括总可地址市场（TAM）、可服务可用市场（SAM）和可服务可获得市场（SOM）计算。","ja":"高度な市場分析機能を必要とするビジネスインテリジェンスエージェントに適しています。包括する機能は、Total Addressable Market（TAM）、Serviceable Available Market（SAM）、Serviceable Obtainable Market（SOM）計算などです。","ko":"고급 시장 분석 기능을 필요로 하는 비즈니스 인텔리전스 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 포함하는 기능은 총 주소 가능 시장(TAM), 서비스 가능한 사용 가능한 시장(SAM), 서비스 가능한 얻을 수 있는 시장(SOM) 계산 등을 포함합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligencia Empresarial que requieren capacidades de análisis de mercado avanzadas, incluyendo cálculos de Mercado Total Abordable (TAM), Mercado Disponible Servible (SAM) y Mercado Obtensible Servible (SOM).","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence d''affaires nécessitant des capacités d''analyse de marché avancées, notamment les calculs de Marché Total Abordable (TAM), de Marché Disponible Serviable (SAM) et de Marché Obtensible Serviable (SOM).","de":"Ideal für Business Intelligence Agents, die erweiterte Marktanalysefunktionen benötigen, einschließlich Berechnungen des Gesamtadressierbaren Marktes (TAM), des verfügbaren bedienbaren Marktes (SAM) und des erreichbaren bedienbaren Marktes (SOM).","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligência de Negócios que requerem capacidades avançadas de análise de mercado, incluindo cálculos de Mercado Total Endereçável (TAM), Mercado Disponível Serviço (SAM) e Mercado Obtenível Serviço (SOM).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-интеллекта, требующих продвинутых возможностей анализа рынка, включая расчеты общего адресуемого рынка (TAM), обслуживаемого доступного рынка (SAM) и обслуживаемого достижимого рынка (SOM).","ar":"مثالي لعميل ذكاء الأعمال الذي يتطلب قدرات تحليل السوق المتقدمة، بما في ذلك حسابات السوق القابل للعنونة الكلية (TAM) والسوق المتاحة الخاضعة للخدمة (SAM) والسوق القابل للتحقيق الخاضعة للخدمة (SOM)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive market opportunity analyses using both bottom-up and top-down methodologies, providing actionable insights for startup business development, including market sizing and growth potential assessments, leveraging technical keywords like TAM, SAM, and SOM.","zh":"赋予代理perform全面市场机会分析的能力，使用自下而上和自上而下的方法ology，提供可行的见解，用于初创企业的业务开发，包括市场规模和增长潜力评估，利用技术关键词如TAM、SAM和SOM。","ja":"エージェントに、ボトムアップとトップダウン方法論を使用して包括的な市場機会分析を実行する能力を付与し、スタートアップの事業開発のための市場規模と成長潜力の評価など、アクション可能な洞察を提供し、TAM、SAM、SOMなどの技術キーワードを活用します。","ko":"에이전트에게全面적인 시장 기회 분석을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 하위에서 상위로와 상위에서 하위로의 방법론을 사용하여, 시장 규모와 성장 잠재력 평가 등을 포함한 스타트업의 비즈니스 개발을 위한 행동 가능한 통찰력을 제공하며, TAM, SAM, SOM 등의 기술 키워드를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar análisis integrales de oportunidades de mercado utilizando metodologías de abajo hacia arriba y de arriba hacia abajo, proporcionando conocimientos aprovechables para el desarrollo empresarial de startups, incluyendo evaluaciones de tamaño y potencial de crecimiento del mercado, aprovechando palabras clave técnicas como TAM, SAM y SOM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des analyses complètes d''opportunités de marché en utilisant à la fois des méthodologies de bas en haut et de haut en bas, fournissant des connaissances exploitables pour le développement d''entreprise de startups, notamment des évaluations de la taille et du potentiel de croissance du marché, en exploitant des mots-clés techniques tels que TAM, SAM et SOM.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Marktchancenanalysen durchzuführen, indem sowohl Bottom-up- als auch Top-down-Methoden verwendet werden, und bietet handhabbare Erkenntnisse für die Unternehmensentwicklung von Start-ups, einschließlich Marktgroßeneinschätzungen und Wachstumspotenzialbewertungen, unter Nutzung technischer Schlüsselwörter wie TAM, SAM und SOM.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análises abrangentes de oportunidades de mercado usando metodologias de baixo para cima e de cima para baixo, fornecendo insights ação para o desenvolvimento de negócios de startup, incluindo avaliações de dimensionamento de mercado e potencial de crescimento, aproveitando palavras-chave técnicas como TAM, SAM e SOM.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить всесторонние анализы рыночных возможностей с использованием как.bottom-up, так и top-down методологий, предоставляя действенные идеи для развития бизнеса стартапов, включая оценки размера рынка и потенциала роста, используя технические ключевые слова, такие как TAM, SAM и SOM.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إجراء تحليلات شاملة لفرص السوق باستخدام المنهجيات من الأسفل إلى الأعلى ومن الأعلى إلى الأسفل، وتقديم رؤى قابلة للتنفيذ لتطوير أعمال الشركات الناشئة، بما في ذلك تقييمات حجم السوق و潜عة النمو، مستفيدا من الكلمات الرئيسية الفنية مثل TAM و SAM و SOM."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating comprehensive market opportunity analyses for startups","Calculating Total Addressable Market (TAM), Serviceable Available Market (SAM), and Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM) using bottom-up and top-down approaches","Informing business development strategies with data-driven market insights"],"zh":["为初创企业生成全面市场机会分析","使用自下而上和自上而下的方法计算总可地址市场（TAM）、可服务可用市场（SAM）和可服务可获得市场（SOM）","使用数据驱动的市场洞察来告知业务开发战略"],"ja":["スタートアップのための包括的な市場機会分析を生成する","ボトムアップとトップダウンアプローチを使用して、Total Addressable Market（TAM）、Serviceable Available Market（SAM）、Serviceable Obtainable Market（SOM）を計算する","データドリブンの市場洞察を使用して事業開発戦略を通知する"],"ko":["스타트업을 위한 포괄적인 시장 기회 분석을 생성합니다.","하위에서 상위로와 상위에서 하위로의 접근 방식을 사용하여 총 주소 가능 시장(TAM), 서비스 가능한 사용 가능한 시장(SAM), 서비스 가능한 얻을 수 있는 시장(SOM)을 계산합니다.","데이터 주도형 시장 통찰력을 사용하여 비즈니스 개발 전략을 정보화합니다."],"es":["Generar análisis integrales de oportunidades de mercado para startups","Calcular el Mercado Total Abordable (TAM), el Mercado Disponible Servible (SAM) y el Mercado Obtensible Servible (SOM) utilizando enfoques de abajo hacia arriba y de arriba hacia abajo","Informar estrategias de desarrollo empresarial con conocimientos de mercado basados en datos"],"fr":["Générer des analyses complètes d''opportunités de marché pour les startups","Calculer le Marché Total Abordable (TAM), le Marché Disponible Serviable (SAM) et le Marché Obtensible Serviable (SOM) en utilisant des approches de bas en haut et de haut en bas","Informer les stratégies de développement d''entreprise avec des connaissances de marché basées sur les données"],"de":["Erstellen umfassender Marktchancenanalysen für Start-ups","Berechnen des Gesamtadressierbaren Marktes (TAM), des verfügbaren bedienbaren Marktes (SAM) und des erreichbaren bedienbaren Marktes (SOM) unter Verwendung von Bottom-up- und Top-down-Ansätzen","Unterstützen von Unternehmensentwicklungsstrategien mit datenbasierten Markterkenntnissen"],"pt":["Gerar análises abrangentes de oportunidades de mercado para startups","Calcular o Mercado Total Endereçável (TAM), o Mercado Disponível Serviço (SAM) e o Mercado Obtenível Serviço (SOM) usando abordagens de baixo para cima e de cima para baixo","Informar estratégias de desenvolvimento de negócios com insights de mercado baseados em dados"],"ru":["Генерировать всесторонние анализы рыночных возможностей для стартапов","Рассчитывать общий адресуемый рынок (TAM), обслуживаемый доступный рынок (SAM) и обслуживаемый достижимый рынок (SOM) с использованием подходов снизу вверх и сверху вниз","Информировать стратегии развития бизнеса данными рыночных прозрений"],"ar":["生成 تحليلات شاملة لفرص السوق للشركات الناشئة","حساب السوق القابل للعنونة الكلية (TAM) والسوق المتاحة الخاضعة للخدمة (SAM) والسوق القابل للتحقيق الخاضعة للخدمة (SOM) باستخدام المناهج من الأسفل إلى الأعلى ومن الأعلى إلى الأسفل","إعلام استراتيجيات تطوير الأعمال بالرؤى القائمة على بيانات السوق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to market data and research reports","Limited to startup business analysis scope"],"zh":["需要访问市场数据和研究报告","仅限于初创企业业务分析范围"],"ja":["市場データと研究レポートへのアクセスが必要","スタートアップの事業分析の範囲に限定される"],"ko":["시장 데이터 및 연구 보고서에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","스타트업의 비즈니스 분석 범위에限定됩니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de mercado e informes de investigación","Limitado al alcance del análisis empresarial de startups"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données de marché et aux rapports de recherche","Limité à la portée de l''analyse d''entreprise de startups"],"de":["Benötigt Zugang zu Marktdaten und Forschungsberichten","Begrenzt auf den Umfang der Unternehmensanalyse von Start-ups"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados de mercado e relatórios de pesquisa","Limitado ao escopo de análise de negócios de startup"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным рынка и отчетам исследований","Ограничен объемом анализа бизнеса стартапов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات السوق وتقارير البحث","محدود نطاق تحليل أعمال الشركات الناشئة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9b032d5a2342d257acd0c39fedb82a72229cc6776140192cddfce099a096a2cb","qualityScore":60}');
