INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('lekman/cdn/github-mcp', 'github-mcp', 'lekman', 'cdn', 'community', 'github-mcp lekman cdn community The github-mcp skill enables developers to access GitHub repositories, issues, and workflows directly from Claude Code, using secure token management via 1Password. It facilitates content-addressed image storage and distribution using Cloudflare CDN with Azure backend. github-mcp是一个使用Cloudflare CDN和Azure后端的内容地址图像存储和分发技能，通过1Password CLI安全地管理GitHub令牌 github-mcpはCloudflare CDNとAzureバックエンドを使用したコンテンツアドレスタイメージストレージと配布スキルで、1Password CLIを使用してGitHubトークンを安全に管理 github-mcp는 Cloudflare CDN과 Azure 백엔드를 사용한 콘텐츠 주소 이미지 저장 및 분산 스킬로, 1Password CLI를 사용하여 GitHub 토큰을 안전하게 관리 El skill github-mcp permite la integración segura con GitHub utilizando 1Password CLI para la gestión de tokens. Ideal para configurar servidores MCP y acceder a repositorios, problemas y solicitudes de extracción de GitHub. Le skill github-mcp permet une intégration sécurisée avec GitHub en utilisant 1Password CLI pour la gestion des tokens. Idéal pour configurer des serveurs MCP et accéder aux référentiels, problèmes et demandes d''extraction de GitHub. Das Skill github-mcp ermöglicht eine sichere Integration mit GitHub unter Verwendung von 1Password CLI für die Tokenverwaltung. Ideal für die Konfiguration von MCP-Servern und den Zugriff auf GitHub-Repositorys, Probleme und Pull-Requests. O github-mcp é uma habilidade que permite a integração segura com o GitHub, utilizando o 1Password CLI para gerenciar tokens de forma segura github-mcp - это навык, который обеспечивает безопасную интеграцию с GitHub, используя 1Password CLI для управления токенами github-mcp هو مهارة تسمح بالتكامل الآمن مع GitHub، باستخدام 1Password CLI لإدارة الرموز بشكل آمن github-mcp setup guide github-mcp alternative github-mcp vs gitlab how to use github-mcp what is github-mcp github-mcp install github-mcp cloudflare integration github-mcp azure backend github-mcp 1password token management github-mcp Cloudflare CDN Azure后端 内容地址图像存储 1Password CLI GitHub令牌管理 AIエージェント 内容分发 图像存储 github-mcp设置 Configures GitHub MCP server for secure repository access Utilizes 1Password CLI for secure token management Enables direct access to GitHub issues, pull requests, and workflows Supports content-addressed image storage and distribution via Cloudflare CDN Integrates with Azure backend for scalable storage and distribution github-mcp is a skill that provides secure GitHub integration for AI agents, enabling access to repositories, issues, and workflows via 1Password token management.');
