de operaciones de GitHub que utiliza el CLI de GitHub","fr":"github-ops est un outil d''automatisation des opérations GitHub qui utilise le CLI GitHub","de":"github-ops ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von GitHub-Operationen, das das GitHub-CLI verwendet","pt":"O github-ops é uma habilidade que proporciona operações do GitHub usando o CLI gh.","ru":"Github-ops - это навык, который обеспечивает операции GitHub с помощью CLI gh.","ar":"github-ops هو مهارة توفر عمليات جيت هاب باستخدام CLI gh"},"features":{"en":["Provides repository management capabilities using the repos.sh script","Supports issue tracking and management using the issues.sh script","Enables viewing, cloning, forking, listing, creating, and deleting repositories","Allows listing, viewing, creating, closing, reopening, and commenting on issues","Requires gh CLI installation and authentication using gh auth login","Offers full GitHub MCP Server parity without token overhead"],"zh":["使用 gh CLI 实现全功能 GitHub MCP 服务器","支持存储库管理（查看、克隆、分叉、列出、创建、删除、内容）","支持问题管理（列出、查看、创建、关闭、重新打开、评论）","无需 token overhead","支持身份验证管理（gh auth login）"],"ja":["gh CLI を使用してトークンオーバーヘッドのない完全な GitHub MCP サーバーを実現","リポジトリ管理（表示、クローン、フォーク、リスト、作成、削除、コンテンツ）をサポート","問題管理（リスト、表示、作成、クローズ、再オープン、コメント）をサポート","トークンオーバーヘッド不要","認証管理（gh auth login）をサポート"],"ko":["gh CLI를 사용하여 전체 GitHub MCP 서버를 제공","저장소 관리（보기、클론、포크、목록、생성、삭제、내용）를 지원","문제 관리（목록、보기、생성、닫기、다시 열기、댓글）를 지원","토큰 오버헤드가 필요하지 않음","인증 관리（gh auth login）를 지원"],"es":["Utiliza el CLI de GitHub para operaciones de repositorio","Soporta operaciones de creación, clonación y eliminación de repositorios","Permite la gestión de incidencias con operaciones de lista, vista y creación","Admite la autenticación con gh auth login","Incluye scripts para repositorios y incidencias","Es compatible con la funcionalidad del servidor MCP de GitHub"],"fr":["Utilise le CLI GitHub pour les opérations de référentiel","Prend en charge les opérations de création, de clonage et de suppression de référentiels","Permet la gestion des problèmes avec des opérations de liste, de vue et de création","Prend en charge l''authentification avec gh auth login","Inclut des scripts pour les référentiels et les problèmes","Est compatible avec la fonctionnalité du serveur MCP GitHub"],"de":["Verwendet das GitHub-CLI für Repository-Operationen","Unterstützt Erstellung-, Klon- und Löschoperationen für Repositorys","Ermöglicht die Verwaltung von Issues mit Listen-, Anzeigen- und Erstellungsvorgängen","Unterstützt die Authentifizierung mit gh auth login","Enthält Skripte für Repositorys und Issues","Ist kompatibel mit der Funktionalität des GitHub-MCP-Servers"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de repositórios com o script repos.sh","Gerenciamento de issues com o script issues.sh","Utilização do CLI gh para automatizar tarefas","Paridade total com o servidor MCP do GitHub","Autenticação com gh auth login"],"ru":["Управление репозиториями с помощью скрипта repos.sh","Управление проблемами с помощью скрипта issues.sh","Использование CLI gh для автоматизации задач","Полная паритетность с сервером MCP GitHub","Аутентификация с помощью gh auth login"],"ar":["إدارة المستودعات باستخدام سكريبت repos.sh","إدارة القضايا باستخدام سكريبت issues.sh","استخدام CLI gh لتحسين المهام","المساواة الكاملة مع خادم MCP لجيت هاب","التحقق باستخدام gh auth login"]},"keywords":{"en":["github-ops setup guide","github-ops alternative","how to use github-ops","github-ops vs git","github-ops install","what is github-ops","github-ops documentation","github-ops tutorial","github-ops benefits","github-ops use cases"],"zh":["GitHub Ops","gh CLI","GitHub MCP 服务器","存储库管理","问题管理","身份验证管理","AI代理","AI工具"],"ja":["GitHub Ops","gh CLI","GitHub MCP サーバー","リポジトリ管理","問題管理","認証管理","AIエージェント","AIツール"],"ko":["GitHub Ops","gh CLI","GitHub MCP 서버","저장소 관리","문제 관리","인증 관리","AI 에이전트","AI 도구"],"es":["github-ops","CLI de GitHub","operaciones de repositorio","gestión de incidencias","autenticación con gh auth login","herramientas de automatización de GitHub","github-ops para desarrolladores","guía de configuración de github-ops","github-ops y CLI de GitHub"],"fr":["github-ops","CLI GitHub","opérations de référentiel","gestion des problèmes","authentification avec gh auth login","outils d''automatisation de GitHub","github-ops pour les développeurs","guide de mise en place de github-ops","github-ops et CLI GitHub"],"de":["github-ops","GitHub-CLI","Repository-Operationen","Issues-Verwaltung","Authentifizierung mit gh auth login","GitHub-Automatisierungstools","github-ops für Entwickler","Einrichtungsleitfaden für github-ops","github-ops und GitHub-CLI"],"pt":["github-ops","CLI gh","gerenciamento de repositórios","gerenciamento de issues","automação de tarefas","paridade com servidor MCP","gh auth login","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["github-ops","CLI gh","управление репозиториями","управление проблемами","автоматизация задач","паритетность с сервером MCP","gh auth login","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["github-ops","CLI gh","إدارة المستودعات","إدارة القضايا","تحسين المهام","المساواة مع خادم MCP","gh auth login","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"chandima","repo":"opencode-config","repoPath":"chandima/opencode-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.265Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-ops","description":"GitHub operations via gh CLI. Use for pull requests/PRs, GitHub code search, or drafting exact gh commands (owner/repo, gh pr list, gh search). Always use instead of WebFetch for github.com.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Operations Skill\n\nFull GitHub MCP Server parity using the `gh` CLI. This skill provides all the functionality of the official GitHub MCP Server without the token overhead.\n\n**Requirements:** `gh` CLI installed and authenticated (`gh auth login`).\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Domain | Script | Key Operations |\n|--------|--------|----------------|\n| Repositories | `repos.sh` | view, clone, fork, list, create, delete, contents |\n| Issues | `issues.sh` | list, view, create, close, reopen, comment","body":"# GitHub Operations Skill\n\nFull GitHub MCP Server parity using the `gh` CLI. This skill provides all the functionality of the official GitHub MCP Server without the token overhead.\n\n**Requirements:** `gh` CLI installed and authenticated (`gh auth login`).\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Domain | Script | Key Operations |\n|--------|--------|----------------|\n| Repositories | `repos.sh` | view, clone, fork, list, create, delete, contents |\n| Issues | `issues.sh` | list, view, create, close, reopen, comment, labels |\n| Pull Requests | `prs.sh` | list, view, create, merge, diff, checks, review |\n| Actions | `actions.sh` | runs, jobs, logs, artifacts, workflows, rerun |\n| Releases | `releases.sh` | list, view, create, delete, download assets |\n| Code Security | `code-security.sh` | code scanning alerts, dependabot alerts |\n| Discussions | `discussions.sh` | list, view, comments, categories |\n| Notifications | `notifications.sh` | list, mark read, subscription |\n| Search | `search.sh` | repos, code, issues, PRs, users, commits |\n| Users | `users.sh` | profile, followers, following, emails |\n| Organizations | `orgs.sh` | info, members, teams, repos |\n| Gists | `gists.sh` | list, view, create, edit, delete |\n| Projects | `projects.sh` | list, view, items, fields (v2) |\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Method 1: Direct Script Execution\n\nRun scripts directly from the skill directory:\n\n```bash\ncd {base_directory}\n\n# Repository operations\nbash scripts/repos.sh view --owner facebook --repo react\nbash scripts/repos.sh contents --owner vercel --repo next.js --path packages\n\n# Issue operations  \nbash scripts/issues.sh list --owner cli --repo cli --state open --limit 10\nbash scripts/issues.sh view --owner cli --repo cli --number 123\n\n# Pull request operations\nbash scripts/prs.sh list --owner facebook --repo react --state open\nbash scripts/prs.sh diff --owner cli --repo cli --number 456\n\n# And so on for each domain...\n```\n\n### Method 2: Router Script\n\nUse the router for unified access:\n\n```bash\ncd {base_directory}\nbash scripts/router.sh repos view --owner facebook --repo react\nbash scripts/router.sh issues list --owner cli --repo cli --state open\nbash scripts/router.sh search repos --query \"language:go stars:>10000\"\n```\n\n### Command-first responses\n\nWhen the user asks for commands or \"exact gh commands\", respond with the command(s) first (gh or scripts), then brief notes if needed. Avoid prose-only answers for command requests.\nIf the user asks to list pull requests or to show the exact commands, always include a literal `gh` command line in the response.\nIf `owner/repo` is missing, still provide the exact `gh` command with `OWNER/REPO` placeholders, then ask the user to confirm the repo.\n\n## Script Reference\n\nEach script follows a consistent pattern:\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/<domain>.sh <action> [options]\n```\n\n### Common Options\n\n| Option | Description | Example |\n|--------|-------------|---------|\n| `--owner` | Repository owner | `--owner facebook` |\n| `--repo` | Repository name | `--repo react` |\n| `--number` | Issue/PR number | `--number 123` |\n| `--limit` | Max results | `--limit 10` |\n| `--state` | Filter by state | `--state open` |\n| `--json` | JSON output | `--json` |\n\n### Safety Rules\n\n**Destructive operations require confirmation:**\n- Creating resources (issues, PRs, releases)\n- Modifying state (close, merge, delete)\n- Force operations\n\nThe scripts will prompt for confirmation before executing destructive actions.\n\n## Available Scripts\n\n### repos.sh - Repository Operations\n\n```bash\n# View repository info\nbash scripts/repos.sh view --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n\n# Get file contents\nbash scripts/repos.sh contents --owner OWNER --repo REPO --path PATH\n\n# List directory\nbash scripts/repos.sh contents --owner OWNER --repo REPO --path PATH --type dir\n\n# Clone repository\nbash scripts/repos.sh clone --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--dir TARGET]\n\n# Fork repository\nbash scripts/repos.sh fork --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n\n# List user''s repos\nbash scripts/repos.sh list [--type owner|member|all] [--limit N]\n\n# Create repository (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/repos.sh create --name NAME [--description DESC] [--private]\n\n# List commits\nbash scripts/repos.sh commits --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--limit N]\n\n# List branches\nbash scripts/repos.sh branches --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n\n# List tags\nbash scripts/repos.sh tags --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n\n# Get default branch\nbash scripts/repos.sh default-branch --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n```\n\n### issues.sh - Issue Operations\n\n```bash\n# List issues\nbash scripts/issues.sh list --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--state open|closed|all] [--label LABEL] [--limit N]\n\n# View issue\nbash scripts/issues.sh view --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER [--comments]\n\n# Create issue (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/issues.sh create --owner OWNER --repo REPO --title TITLE [--body BODY] [--labels L1,L2]\n\n# Close issue (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/issues.sh close --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# Reopen issue\nbash scripts/issues.sh reopen --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# Add comment\nbash scripts/issues.sh comment --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER --body BODY\n\n# Update issue\nbash scripts/issues.sh update --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER [--title T] [--body B]\n\n# List issue comments\nbash scripts/issues.sh comments --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# Add labels\nbash scripts/issues.sh add-labels --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER --labels L1,L2\n\n# Remove labels\nbash scripts/issues.sh remove-labels --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER --labels L1,L2\n```\n\n### prs.sh - Pull Request Operations\n\n```bash\n# List PRs\nbash scripts/prs.sh list --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--state open|closed|merged|all] [--limit N]\n\n# View PR\nbash scripts/prs.sh view --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER [--comments]\n\n# View PR diff\nbash scripts/prs.sh diff --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# View PR files\nbash scripts/prs.sh files --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# Check PR status\nbash scripts/prs.sh checks --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# Create PR (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/prs.sh create --owner OWNER --repo REPO --title TITLE --head BRANCH [--base main] [--body BODY]\n\n# Merge PR (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/prs.sh merge --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER [--method merge|squash|rebase]\n\n# Close PR\nbash scripts/prs.sh close --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# Add review\nbash scripts/prs.sh review --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER --event approve|comment|request_changes [--body BODY]\n\n# List reviews\nbash scripts/prs.sh reviews --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# Get merge status\nbash scripts/prs.sh merge-status --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n```\n\n### actions.sh - GitHub Actions\n\n```bash\n# List workflow runs\nbash scripts/actions.sh runs --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--workflow FILE] [--status STATUS] [--limit N]\n\n# View run details\nbash scripts/actions.sh run --owner OWNER --repo REPO --run-id ID\n\n# List jobs in a run\nbash scripts/actions.sh jobs --owner OWNER --repo REPO --run-id ID\n\n# Get job logs\nbash scripts/actions.sh logs --owner OWNER --repo REPO --run-id ID [--job-id JOB_ID] [--failed-only]\n\n# List artifacts\nbash scripts/actions.sh artifacts --owner OWNER --repo REPO --run-id ID\n\n# Download artifact\nbash scripts/actions.sh download-artifact --owner OWNER --repo REPO --artifact-id ID\n\n# List workflows\nbash scripts/actions.sh workflows --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n\n# Rerun workflow (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/actions.sh rerun --owner OWNER --repo REPO --run-id ID\n\n# Rerun failed jobs (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/actions.sh rerun-failed --owner OWNER --repo REPO --run-id ID\n\n# Cancel run (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/actions.sh cancel --owner OWNER --repo REPO --run-id ID\n\n# Trigger workflow (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/actions.sh dispatch --owner OWNER --repo REPO --workflow FILE [--ref BRANCH] [--inputs JSON]\n```\n\n### releases.sh - Release Operations\n\n```bash\n# List releases\nbash scripts/releases.sh list --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--limit N]\n\n# View release\nbash scripts/releases.sh view --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--tag TAG]\n\n# View latest release\nbash scripts/releases.sh latest --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n\n# Download release assets\nbash scripts/releases.sh download --owner OWNER --repo REPO --tag TAG [--pattern GLOB]\n\n# Create release (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/releases.sh create --owner OWNER --repo REPO --tag TAG [--title TITLE] [--notes NOTES] [--draft] [--prerelease]\n\n# Delete release (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/releases.sh delete --owner OWNER --repo REPO --tag TAG\n\n# Upload asset (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/releases.sh upload --owner OWNER --repo REPO --tag TAG --file FILE\n```\n\n### code-security.sh - Code Security\n\n```bash\n# List code scanning alerts\nbash scripts/code-security.sh code-alerts --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--state open|closed|all] [--severity LEVEL]\n\n# View code scanning alert\nbash scripts/code-security.sh code-alert --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# List Dependabot alerts\nbash scripts/code-security.sh dependabot-alerts --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--state open|closed|all] [--severity LEVEL]\n\n# View Dependabot alert\nbash scripts/code-security.sh dependabot-alert --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# List secret scanning alerts\nbash scripts/code-security.sh secret-alerts --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--state open|resolved]\n\n# View secret scanning alert\nbash scripts/code-security.sh secret-alert --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n```\n\n### discussions.sh - Discussions\n\n```bash\n# List discussions\nbash scripts/discussions.sh list --owner OWNER --repo REPO [--category CATEGORY] [--limit N]\n\n# View discussion\nbash scripts/discussions.sh view --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# List discussion comments\nbash scripts/discussions.sh comments --owner OWNER --repo REPO --number NUMBER\n\n# List discussion categories\nbash scripts/discussions.sh categories --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n\n# Create discussion (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/discussions.sh create --owner OWNER --repo REPO --title TITLE --body BODY --category SLUG\n```\n\n### notifications.sh - Notifications\n\n```bash\n# List notifications\nbash scripts/notifications.sh list [--all] [--participating] [--limit N]\n\n# Mark as read\nbash scripts/notifications.sh mark-read [--thread-id ID]\n\n# Get thread\nbash scripts/notifications.sh thread --id ID\n\n# Subscribe/unsubscribe\nbash scripts/notifications.sh subscribe --owner OWNER --repo REPO\nbash scripts/notifications.sh unsubscribe --owner OWNER --repo REPO\n```\n\n### search.sh - Search Operations\n\n```bash\n# Search repositories\nbash scripts/search.sh repos --query QUERY [--limit N] [--sort stars|forks|updated]\n\n# Search code\nbash scripts/search.sh code --query QUERY [--limit N]\n\n# Search issues\nbash scripts/search.sh issues --query QUERY [--limit N]\n\n# Search PRs\nbash scripts/search.sh prs --query QUERY [--limit N]\n\n# Search users\nbash scripts/search.sh users --query QUERY [--limit N]\n\n# Search commits\nbash scripts/search.sh commits --query QUERY [--limit N]\n```\n\n### users.sh - User Operations\n\n```bash\n# Get current user\nbash scripts/users.sh me\n\n# Get user profile\nbash scripts/users.sh profile --username USERNAME\n\n# List followers\nbash scripts/users.sh followers [--username USERNAME] [--limit N]\n\n# List following\nbash scripts/users.sh following [--username USERNAME] [--limit N]\n\n# List user''s repos\nbash scripts/users.sh repos --username USERNAME [--limit N]\n\n# List user''s gists\nbash scripts/users.sh gists --username USERNAME [--limit N]\n\n# Get user emails (authenticated user only)\nbash scripts/users.sh emails\n```\n\n### orgs.sh - Organization Operations\n\n```bash\n# View organization\nbash scripts/orgs.sh view --org ORG\n\n# List members\nbash scripts/orgs.sh members --org ORG [--role admin|member|all] [--limit N]\n\n# List teams\nbash scripts/orgs.sh teams --org ORG [--limit N]\n\n# View team\nbash scripts/orgs.sh team --org ORG --team TEAM_SLUG\n\n# List team members\nbash scripts/orgs.sh team-members --org ORG --team TEAM_SLUG [--limit N]\n\n# List org repos\nbash scripts/orgs.sh repos --org ORG [--type all|public|private] [--limit N]\n```\n\n### gists.sh - Gist Operations\n\n```bash\n# List gists\nbash scripts/gists.sh list [--public] [--secret] [--limit N]\n\n# View gist\nbash scripts/gists.sh view --id ID\n\n# Create gist (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/gists.sh create --filename FILE --content CONTENT [--description DESC] [--public]\n\n# Edit gist (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/gists.sh edit --id ID --filename FILE --content CONTENT\n\n# Delete gist (requires confirmation)\nbash scripts/gists.sh delete --id ID\n\n# Fork gist\nbash scripts/gists.sh fork --id ID\n```\n\n### projects.sh - Projects v2\n\n```bash\n# List projects\nbash scripts/projects.sh list --owner OWNER [--limit N]\n\n# View project\nbash scripts/projects.sh view --owner OWNER --number NUMBER\n\n# List project items\nbash scripts/projects.sh items --owner OWNER --number NUMBER [--limit N]\n\n# List project fields\nbash scripts/projects.sh fields --owner OWNER --number NUMBER\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\nAll scripts follow these error handling rules:\n\n1. **Max 2 attempts** per operation before failing\n2. Clear error messages with suggestions\n3. Exit codes: 0 = success, 1 = error, 2 = user cancelled\n\n## Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Check auth status\ngh auth status\n\n# Login\ngh auth login\n\n# Refresh with additional scopes\ngh auth refresh -s repo -s workflow -s read:org\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nEdit `config/toolsets.json` to enable/disable feature groups:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"enabled\": [\"repos\", \"issues\", \"prs\", \"actions\", \"users\"],\n  \"disabled\": [\"projects\", \"gists\"]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**MCP Parity:** This skill provides equivalent functionality to all GitHub MCP Server toolsets.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:59:52.813Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated GitHub repository management and issue tracking using the gh CLI.","zh":"适用于需要自动化 GitHub 仓库管理和问题跟踪的开发代理，使用 gh CLI。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの自動化された管理と問題追跡を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。gh CLI を使用します。","ko":"자동화된 GitHub 리포지토리 관리 및 이슈 추적이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며 gh CLI를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una gestión automática de repositorios de GitHub y seguimiento de problemas utilizando el CLI de gh.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion automatisée de référentiels GitHub et un suivi de problèmes à l''aide du CLI gh.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte GitHub-Repository-Verwaltung und Problemmeldungsverfolgung unter Verwendung des gh-CLI erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento automatizado de repositórios GitHub e acompanhamento de problemas usando o gh CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов развития, требующих автоматизированного управления репозиториями GitHub и отслеживания проблем с помощью gh CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يتطلبون إدارة مستودع GitHub التلقائي وتتبع المشكلات باستخدام gh CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform repository operations like cloning, forking, and deleting, as well as issue management tasks such as listing, viewing, and commenting, all through the gh CLI with full GitHub MCP Server parity, eliminating token overhead.","zh":"赋予代理执行仓库操作的能力，例如克隆、分叉和删除，以及问题管理任务，例如列出、查看和评论，所有这些都通过 gh CLI 实现，具有完整的 GitHub MCP 服务器功能等价性，消除了令牌开销。","ja":"エージェントが、gh CLI を使用して、リポジトリ操作（クローン、フォーク、削除など）や問題管理タスク（リスト表示、表示、コメントなど）を実行できるようにします。GitHub MCP サーバーの完全な等価性を提供し、トークンのオーバーヘッドを排除します。","ko":"에이전트가 gh CLI를 사용하여 리포지토리 작업(클론, 포크, 삭제 등) 및 이슈 관리 작업(목록 표시, 표시, 댓글 등)을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. 완전한 GitHub MCP 서버 동일성을 제공하고 토큰 오버헤드를 제거합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar operaciones de repositorio como clonar, bifurcar y eliminar, así como tareas de administración de problemas como listar, ver y comentar, todo a través del CLI de gh con paridad completa del servidor MCP de GitHub, eliminando la sobrecarga de tokens.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des opérations de référentiel telles que le clonage, la bifurcation et la suppression, ainsi que des tâches de gestion de problèmes telles que la liste, la visualisation et le commentaire, le tout via le CLI gh avec une parité complète du serveur MCP GitHub, éliminant la surcharge de jetons.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Repository-Operationen wie Klonen, Forken und Löschen durchzuführen, sowie Problemmeldungsverwaltungsaufgaben wie Auflisten, Anzeigen und Kommentieren, alles über den gh-CLI mit voller GitHub-MCP-Server-Parität, wodurch die Token-Overhead eliminiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar operações de repositório como clonar, bifurcar e excluir, bem como tarefas de gerenciamento de problemas, como listar, visualizar e comentar, tudo por meio do gh CLI com paridade total do servidor GitHub MCP, eliminando a sobrecarga de token.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять операции с репозиториями, такие как клонирование, ветвление и удаление, а также задачи управления проблемами, такие как перечисление, просмотр и комментирование, все через gh CLI с полным совпадением сервера GitHub MCP, исключая накладные расходы на токены.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إجراء عمليات المستودع مثل الاستنساخ والتفريع والحذف، بالإضافة إلى مهام إدارة المشكلات مثل قائمة والاطلاع والتعليق، كل ذلك من خلال gh CLI مع مساواة كاملة للخادم GitHub MCP، مما يلغي الحمل الزائد للرمز."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating repository creation and deletion","Streamlining issue tracking and commenting","Cloning and forking repositories for development purposes"],"zh":["自动化仓库创建和删除","简化问题跟踪和评论","为开发目的克隆和分叉仓库"],"ja":["リポジトリの作成と削除の自動化","問題追跡とコメントの簡素化","開発目的のためのリポジトリのクローンとフォーク"],"ko":["리포지토리 생성 및 삭제 자동화","이슈 추적 및 댓글 단순화","개발 목적을 위한 리포지토리 클론 및 포크"],"es":["Automatización de la creación y eliminación de repositorios","Optimización del seguimiento y comentario de problemas","Clonación y bifurcación de repositorios para fines de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automation de la création et de la suppression de référentiels","Optimisation de la surveillance et du commentaire de problèmes","Clonage et bifurcation de référentiels à des fins de développement"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung und Löschung von Repositorys","Optimierung der Problemmeldungsverfolgung und -kommentierung","Klonen und Forken von Repositorys für Entwicklungszwecke"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação e exclusão de repositórios","Padronizar o acompanhamento e comentários de problemas","Clonar e bifurcar repositórios para fins de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание и удаление репозиториев","Оптимизировать отслеживание и комментирование проблем","Клонировать и ветвить репозитории для целей разработки"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في إنشاء وحذف المستودعات","تبسيط تتبع وتعليقات المشكلات","استنساخ وتفريع المستودعات لأغراض التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires gh CLI installed and authenticated (gh auth login)"],"zh":["需要安装和认证 gh CLI（gh auth login）"],"ja":["gh CLI をインストールして認証する必要がある（gh auth login）"],"ko":["gh CLI를 설치하고 인증해야 함(gh auth login)"],"es":["Requiere el CLI de gh instalado y autenticado (gh auth login)"],"fr":["Nécessite le CLI gh installé et authentifié (gh auth login)"],"de":["Benötigt den gh-CLI installiert und authentifiziert (gh auth login)"],"pt":["Exige o gh CLI instalado e autenticado (gh auth login)"],"ru":["Требует установленного и аутентифицированного gh CLI (gh auth login)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتأشير gh CLI (gh auth login)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"57c30c1ba9e9bda15e414b6c8bd267a8e32175dae6b12148a77015ae5015a215","qualityScore":60}');
